      "title": "Accounting, Full-Time Lecturer, Faculty",
      "url": "https://careers.mtsu.edu/jobs/accounting-full-time-lecturer-faculty-murfreesboro-tennessee-tennessee-united-states-0d780e62-90a1-4ba6-bb6c-8eff4de74b72",
